{"version":1,"content":"<p>女神郭珮文（Juliana）前度俞鋆瑞（Ice）為求復合，特意由美國飛香港參加無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》，誠意十足，不少網民大讚兩人合襯，望他們能成功翻撻。</p><p>已留港3月的Ice昨日無預警下宣布已返回美國洛杉磯，即時惹來不少網民揣測。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:12.136328+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:26:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:19.225670+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:19.225670+00:00","content_hash":"495ea47131ad86fd10003e181d24c76950a27aca135eba854b1ef598b73ef7d2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}